* AD8092 Non-Inverting Amplifier, Av = +5 V/V, +/-5 V Supplies
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* Genuine ADI SPICE macromodel for the AD8092 is instantiated below.
* Pin order of the ADI model subcircuit: (+IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT)
* Place AD8092.cir (ADI model file) in the simulation directory or
* in the LTspice library search path.
.include AD8092.cir

* ---------------- Supplies ----------------
VCC  VCC 0 DC  5
VEE  VEE 0 DC -5

* ---------------- Input signal ----------------
* 100 mV amplitude sine at 1 MHz (AC 1 also set for optional .ac sweep)
VIN  IN 0 DC 0 AC 1 SINE(0 0.1 1MEG)

* ---------------- Amplifier ----------------
XU1  IN FB VCC VEE OUT AD8092

* Non-inverting gain = 1 + RF/RG = 1 + 1k/250 = 5 (13.98 dB)
RF   OUT FB 1k
RG   FB  0  250

* ---------------- Load ----------------
RL   OUT 0 1k

* ---------------- Analysis ----------------
.tran 0 5u 0 100p
* Optional small-signal frequency response:
* .ac dec 100 10k 500MEG

.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7
.end
